{"id":"wb-2-30","name":"悬空寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"悬空寺","text":"悬空寺，位于中国山西省大同市浑源县，是一座儒释道三教合一的寺庙。该寺始建于北魏年间，现存建筑均为明清时期重建。整座寺庙建于翠峰山的半山腰上，依靠27根木梁支撑全部寺庙主要建筑，远看形如悬在半空，故名悬空寺。整座寺庙共有40间房屋，为木质框架式结构，主体建筑之间由走廊和栈道相连。1982年，悬空寺被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%82%AC%E7%A9%BA%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":92622300,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92622300","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f9d60fe93c255a22ac3a2f7c.jpg","title":"Hangingtemple20190929.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hangingtemple20190929.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Hangingtemple20190929.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Charlie fong","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​山西浑源悬空寺，2019年9月。","width":320,"height":180}}